ace manufacturers; diffuser segments for bell/batch annealing furnaces; charging/discharging rollers of reheating furnaces; and heating elements for annealing furnace of decarb lines. In addition, the company exports its products. Uni Abex Alloy Products Limited was incorporated in 1972 and is based in Mumbai, India."}}